  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.03 Applicable law",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.03 “Applicable law” means the state and federal statute(s), rules, standing orders, and case law, if any, that apply to regulate a profession in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #12863, eff 9-4-19; ss by #13293, eff 11-24-21; ss by #13797, eff 10-26-23 ; ss by #14135, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.04)",
